# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentinel Workspace — curated seed repo
#
# This repo is NOT a dump of the local workspace.
#   scratch/   → throwaway experiments + archived legacy. Never tracked.
#   modules/   → the curated technique library. Fully tracked; only
#                harvested, documented techniques live here (see
#                knowledge/technique-catalogue.md). Junk goes to scratch/.
#   projects/  → allowlisted; only blessed example shows are tracked.
# To ship a new project: add a `!projects/<name>/` line below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Generated / local artifacts ──────────────────────────────
captures/
**/captures/
refs/
vision.json
*.previous
projects/recovery_*.sentinel
# per-project proof bundles are point-in-time artifacts, regenerated on demand
projects/*/proof/
*.log
# compiled shader caches (regenerated on load; build/GPU-specific)
**/shader_cache/
# scratch: throwaway experiments + archived legacy modules. Never shipped.
scratch/

# ── Curated module library ───────────────────────────────────
# modules/ is fully tracked — it holds only harvested, documented
# techniques. Throwaway experiments live in scratch/ (ignored above),
# never here. A harvested technique auto-tracks; no allowlist needed.

# ── Curated projects ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore all projects, then re-include the shipped ones.
projects/*
!projects/topographic_hud/
!projects/fui_dashboard/
!projects/abstract_ribbon_poster/
!projects/skyscraper/
!projects/desert_totem/
!projects/strata/
!projects/kidpix_canvas/
!projects/fruit_atlas_scatter/
!projects/interaction_lab/
!projects/living_room_sdf/
!projects/face_collage/
!projects/industrial_lattice/
!projects/showcase_gallery/
!projects/streamdiff_workflows/
!projects/streamdiff_collage/
!projects/procedural_building_system/
!projects/cryogram/
!projects/autopsia/
